    "allowed_changed": "SetAllowed Boolean equal guard applies. Unequal true->false calls SwitchAllowedChanged0xcffc64, which clears Active only if stilltrue at0xcffc8d. Existing Allowedfalse,Activetrue plus aggregatefalse preservesActive because equalfalse emits no callback.",
